  "content": "<h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1186313/description_a135d07a-8f95-4b0e-838a-8818cd382933.png\" height=\"169\"></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958369/description_8e8662dd-5523-44a1-9844-15600b82746c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"712\" height=\"18\"></h3><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958369/description_544ec984-6c52-4b7b-8c25-570f96ab6214.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"50\"></p><ul>\n<li>儲存每種已設定的寶庫果實各一組。</li>\n<li>撿起的寶庫果實可設定為直接存入果實袋。（預設：關閉）</li>\n<li>使用以消耗所選果實。</li>\n<li>潛行 + 滾輪以切換所選果實。</li>\n<li>可透過潛行 + 右鍵開啟。</li>\n<li>可在鐵砧中與靈魂綁定寶石結合來添加靈魂綁定效果。（預設：關閉）</li>\n</ul><h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/958369/description_8e8662dd-5523-44a1-9844-15600b82746c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"712\" height=\"18\"></h3>",
